        	<div class="intro-text type1">
            	<h4> Lifetopia is the leading provider of mobile and web based housing solutions for colleges and universities.</h4>
<p>Lifetopia's products are designed with the input and assistance of the Housing and Residence Life Staff from small colleges to large universities. Our focus and attention towards providing user friendly web 3.0 technologies helps to streamline and simplify many of the tedious business processes while providing powerful reporting solutions. We pride ourselves on our customer service and look forward to working with your school. 
</p>

		
                <h6> </h6>
