            <div class="column one-fourth">
                <div class="ico-content type1">
                	<div class="icon"> <span class="icon-cogs"> </span> </div>
                    <h5> <a href="contact.html" title="">Room Condition Reports</a> </h5>
                    <p> Go Green! Lifetopia's mobile Room Inventory and Condition Reporting solution is advanced technology that allows you to take a paperless approach to saving storage, time, and money through mobile technology and web-based solutions. </p>
                									<a title="" class="button small purple" href="room_inventory_control.html">Find out More</a> <br>

				</div>
            </div>
            <div class="column one-fourth">
                <div class="ico-content type1">
                	<div class="icon"> <span class="icon-leaf"> </span> </div>
                    <h5> <a href="contact.html" title="">Housing Management</a> </h5>
                    <p> Lifetopia's Housing Management System is an affordable user-friendly platform that provides solutions for managing residence life without the headaches. The technology provides administrators the capability to automate assignments, view and track student progress, view historical data, and take advantage of our powerful reporting tools. Our web-based capabilities enable students to help themselves with online roommate searches, housing applications, building and bed selections, and much more. </p>
                									<a title="" class="button small purple" href="Housing_management_system.html">Find out More</a> <br>

				</div>
            </div>
            <div class="column one-fourth">
                <div class="ico-content type1">
                	<div class="icon"> <span class="icon-trophy"> </span> </div>
                    <h5> <a href="contact.html" title=""> Roommate Matching </a> </h5>
                    <p> Lifetopia Roommates offers a seamless student portal that allows individuals to search possible roommates, housing options, meal plans, and more. With our secure online social network, students can make connections with other classmates prior to setting foot on campus. </p>
                									<a title="" class="button small purple" href="roommate_self_selection.html">Find out More</a> <br>

				</div>
            </div>
            <div class="column one-fourth last">
                <div class="ico-content type1">
                	<div class="icon"> <span class="icon-laptop"> </span> </div>
                    <h5> <a href="contact.html" title="">Off Campus Housing</a> </h5>
                    <p> Lifetopia's Off Campus Housing Solution (<a href="Off_campus_housing.html">OffCampusListing.com</a>) centralizes the housing department's off-campus housing inventory into a single online marketplace within the school's website. Built with our award winning roommate matching solution, students are able to securely view all available housing options and make their selections online. For students unfamiliar with the local area, detailed maps and safety zones can be designated. Our solution allows the housing department to set the criteria for approved housing, including listing rates, as well as provide administrative oversight.</p>
                									<a title="" class="button small purple" href="Off_campus_housing.html">Find out More</a> <br>

				</div>
